    "The administration presents the arrangement as an opportunity to strengthen American energy security while rebuilding Venezuela’s petroleum industry.",
    "The long-term distribution of the economic benefits will depend on production costs, contractual terms, investment and the revenues ultimately received by Venezuela.",
    "Who Benefits From the Chaos?",
    "Several groups stand to benefit from the restructuring of Venezuela's oil economy.",
