    "The identities of the ultimate recipients of much of the foreign exchange remain undisclosed. The public cannot fully determine which Venezuelan companies received dollars, on what terms or whether smaller businesses had comparable access.",
    "The Accountability Question",
    "In September, American senators sent a letter to Treasury Secretary Scott Bessent and Secretary of State Marco Rubio requesting greater transparency about Venezuela’s natural resource revenue.",
